@startuml
actor PE
actor Developer
participant Console
participant CatalogService
participant HardenedGit
participant Inspectors
database Store
participant Planner
participant Executor
PE -> Console : register source / refresh
Console -> CatalogService : authenticated Organization
CatalogService -> HardenedGit : branch + tag discovery
HardenedGit --> CatalogService : tip, peeled commits, ancestry evidence
loop each eligible unchanged observed tag
 CatalogService -> Inspectors : exact commit + strict manifest
 Inspectors --> CatalogService : verified pins + Definition snapshots
 CatalogService -> Store : transaction: CAS source + complete release INSERT
end
Developer -> Console : choose Environment release
Console -> CatalogService : expected Environment version + selection revision
CatalogService -> Store : lock Environment; save desired + platform binding snapshot
Developer -> Console : Preview
Console -> Store : read snapshot: release definitions, account versions, desired config
Console -> Planner : immutable release pins, existing state identities
Planner --> Console : graph, changes/blockers, token
Developer -> Console : Deploy(token)
Console -> Store : claim operation + recheck pins
Console -> Executor : admitted graph + verified cache
loop required components
 Executor -> Store : fenced acknowledgements, original/new pins
end
alt all required work succeeded
 Console -> Store : fenced applied release activation
else error or unknown outcome
 Console -> Store : retain applied release; mark partial, preserve component outcomes
end
@enduml
